Comment: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, if my old buddies saw me like this, it'd bring a tear to their eyes!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This cake's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a pitiful body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Iorogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, can I put a ribbon on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Him? You mean Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, gimme a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he loves it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell would love this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our best today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my way, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the doing carrying that around with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it's important to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy, yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cook, cook the baumkuchen, cook it, cook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bears of the forest are cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in, Ginsei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what did you come for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we're like this now, we're from the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you bringing that--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's start from the beginning, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's Heaven, the human world, the underworld, and the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Humans are the only ones that don't know about the other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In Heaven, God rules over the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the underworld, the Devil rules over the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And in the spirit world, the Spirit Lord rules over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Each of these worlds is unassailable in principle, but that damn fool Iorogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? He's a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:05:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're like this because that idiot tried starting a war with Heaven, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's gotta be something there he really wanted to make him do that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he didn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He should've just tried to filch it like that devil brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, because we lost and he shattered the inviolability of the worlds, he got turned into a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a baumkuchen-cooking bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my Zuisho is a weird bird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even God ran out of patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With all of us, but he was the ringleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So how does Iorogi get back to the spirit world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until that girl fulfills her wish, he's stuck in that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:05:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By healing humans' scarred hearts, and filling that bottle, her wish will be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Helping her is the deal he made with God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I can tell you that ever since he came to the human world...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, ever since he's been with that girl, he's been a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should let him be for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, go ahead, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It came out tasty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, if my old buddies saw me like this, it'd bring a tear to their eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here, It!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you at the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was looking for Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lunchtime, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wash your hands and come inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I figured you should come to lecture today, so I came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... What's a lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lecture, at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's something you do in college?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They've been taking attendance lately, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really should show up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please go, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't, I'm too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough. You have an important lecture this afternoon, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've helped out here plenty before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's when I realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're having naptime today, and Kobato's helping out. It will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always so helpful, but I want you to go to school too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he's so obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only to Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell kind of fairy-tale getup is this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do Fujimoto's work too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! That bastard Fujimoto tied it on so tight I can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go home and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That ribbon suits little Ioryogi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Little... Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Anyway, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's still a bit hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll probably be cooler on dirt rather than pavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oww!  Why'd you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all tense right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The seasons are changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't come here to help out at the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto wasn't there today, so I wanted to cover for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do what you're here for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry and fill this bottle up, your wish won't come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:14:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you break that, you're gonna regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you sticking around the human world in that body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zuisho! Quit making a ruckus inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get feathers in the dough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help it, I'm a bird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know. Anyway, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw it! That selfish, violent guy that's a stuffed animal now and that other guy look like they're about to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:15:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, take this and give it to the loser as a consolation prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean we should let them do it? It looks like it'll get pretty ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no stopping those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi was the one who took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He even named him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei, after his silver eyes. {let's see how many people remember that he wasn't a fluffy eyepatched bunny when they met.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it's still come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to hold them back, but I guess it's come down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's got a creepy fixation on Iorogi because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're the only ones that can settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give that bottle back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:16:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come and get it yourself, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Feel like getting burnt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't pin me down with that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your body and your name. What's this "Ioryogi" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Io... Ryo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Iorogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Iorogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm perfectly fine with what she calls me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now give me that bottle back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come back to the spirit world and ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I've got something to do first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go back until I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about that "wish", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does she mean to you, anyway!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's been pretty mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So why not get rid of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without her, there'd be no wish to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be able to return to the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The old you would've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She is pretty clumsy and dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's always putting other people first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though she's useless, she wrecks herself trying to help other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:18:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't mind that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's how you really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she can't fill the bottle, her wish won't come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So without it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel like taking orders from you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give back that bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without it, Kobato will...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since he's been with that girl, he's been a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Please"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The old you never would have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't find Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was in Sakura Park...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Catch me if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:19:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why you--!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:20:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was having fun chasing one of his friends from the spirit world around, so I didn't stop and say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura Park, huh? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, this body's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.43,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if I've come this far...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That hurts, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:20:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for finding him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he was gonna become a stray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A stray?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You care that much about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! We're always together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That bear always knows just what's needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It suits you so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks so much for getting the bottle back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato! Minus 200 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing losing your precious bottle!? You don't deserve any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this, Fancy Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's wrapping me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're always together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.15,0:22:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.37,0:22:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ribbons really do suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong! Another one would be even better...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And another...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.26,0:22:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:47.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:55.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:01:05.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:11.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:18.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:24.48,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:29.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:35.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:41.66,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:48.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:57.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Silver Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:08.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:15.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:23.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:32.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:43.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:45.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:54.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:24:01.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:11.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:15.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:28.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}...Angel and Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.17,0:23:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
